# The image build's context is this folder, and the Dockerfile copies it
# (COPY . /ctx) to pick up an amdgpu-install package put here. Only that
# package may be part of it: with README.md, build.sh and the rest in the
# context, any edit to one of them made Docker run the ROCm steps again
# (several GB). The Dockerfile itself is always sent.
*
!amdgpu-install_*.deb
